sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as /api/v1/executions or /visual-ui
    participant C as Celery
    participant W as Worker
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant RP as RightPupilEngine
    participant OM as OmniParser
    participant R as Runner/Playwright
    participant H as Healer node
    participant EX as ExecutionService
    participant DB as DB

    U->>FE: Trigger UI execution
    FE->>API: POST execution
    API->>C: enqueue
    C-->>W: deliver
    W->>D: execute step
    D->>RP: execute_step(...)
    RP->>OM: parse screenshot
    OM-->>RP: elements
    RP->>R: perform action
    R--x RP: action failed (locator/intercept/etc)

    RP->>H: analyze failure_type + propose fix
    H-->>RP: corrected action (retry)
    RP->>R: retry corrected action

    alt retry still fails / max retries reached
        RP-->>D: success=false, error=ABORT
        D-->>W: failed StepResult
        W->>EX: create_step_result(status=ERROR, error=healing_failed)
        EX->>DB: insert step
        W->>EX: update_execution_status(FAILED)
        EX->>DB: update execution
        FE->>API: GET /executions/{id}/result
        API-->>FE: failed + healing/fallback error context
    else retry succeeds
        RP-->>D: success=true
        D-->>W: continue next step
    end
